# Evolution-style account discovery and synchronization transcript.

C: A001 ID ("name" "Evolution" "version" "3.58")
S: A001 OK

C: A002 LOGIN "user@example.test" "password"
S: A002 OK

C: A003 NAMESPACE
S: A003 OK

C: A004 LIST (SPECIAL-USE) "" "*" RETURN (SUBSCRIBED CHILDREN STATUS (MESSAGES UNSEEN UIDNEXT UIDVALIDITY HIGHESTMODSEQ))
S: * LIST (\HasNoChildren \Subscribed)
S: * STATUS "Archive" (MESSAGES 0
S: A004 OK

C: A005 ENABLE QRESYNC UTF8=ACCEPT
S: A005 OK

C: A006 SELECT INBOX (CONDSTORE)
S: * 2 EXISTS
S: HIGHESTMODSEQ
S: A006 OK

C: A007 UID FETCH 1:* (UID FLAGS MODSEQ RFC822.SIZE INTERNALDATE ENVELOPE BODYSTRUCTURE BODY.PEEK[HEADER.FIELDS (DATE FROM TO CC SUBJECT MESSAGE-ID REFERENCES IN-REPLY-TO)])
S: * 1 FETCH (FLAGS
S: BODYSTRUCTURE
S: A007 OK

C: A008 UID SEARCH RETURN (MIN MAX ALL COUNT) ALL
S: * ESEARCH (TAG "A008") UID MIN 1 MAX 2 ALL 1:2 COUNT 2
S: A008 OK

C: A009 LOGOUT
S: A009 OK
